e house and playground constructed by Builderman. There were two weapons: the slingshot and the rocket launcher. I remember the first time we noticed a user, “dergenx”, actually playing our game, everyone on the team got on and played with him for an hour. It was very exciting. Since the original Crossroads was published, it has been added onto many times as we push the state of the art forward.\" ~ Shedletsky, December 11th, 2006 \"Now We are 10,000\" - Celebrating the 10,000th Roblox user.","path":"/game/1818-crossroads","slug":"1818-crossroads","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a8125770f1b596bb326ede6af6da358a621da46c0270aa90431c424e78fc5dea.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-672284ae50f6bece92ce3c92c1ea6067/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":39720317,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-22T20:27:00.006Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6220960770,"name":"Blades World ⚔️","desc":"Welcome to the World of Blades!\n\n⚡Train to become more POWERFUL\n🤺 FIGHT other players\n💪 DOMINATE the server\n⚔️ Unlock and unbox RARE BLADES\n\n(Exciting updates every week!)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGames this is related to:\nSword Simulator, Sword Simulator 2, Weapon Masters, Weapon Simulator, Scythe Simulator, Reborn As Swordman, Strong Sword Simulator, Weapon Legends Simulator","path":"/game/6220960770-blades-world","slug":"6220960770-blades-world","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fa41a17bcdd95476462fb5e1729576a91969fb544f10c4c68d42261c8c966a08.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f3e2710106a88df7b28c1d1f3710bf71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":13733614,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-07T18:53:52.549Z","creator":{"name":"Blades World","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5915341487,"name":"Pancake's Wall Hop Difficulty Chart","desc":"Welcome to Pancakes Wallhop Diffic